<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-SEMA FIRST-HALF PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-SEMA FIRST-HALF PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>				  (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  738,000 vs  2.9</p>
<p>    Turnover			    17.7    vs 24.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    877,600 vs 3.8</p>
<p>    Operating costs		   3.46    vs 3.56</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  1.9     vs 4.5</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		14,700  vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE -- Sema, which makes spirits for drinks, had a 6.4</p>
<p>million litas net profit in 1996 and turnover of 54.77 million</p>
<p>litas for 1996.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
</text>
